            "review_title": "Review at Vietnam House Restaurant @ Union Square",
            "review_text": "Glenn Y\n7 contributions\n0\nfabulous !!\nOct 2026 • Couples\nfabulous high quality and delicious ! owned by famous chef Luke Nguyen (owns Red Lantern in Syndey). this will not disappoint !! wait staff are wonderful also. traditional dessert was incredible.\nWritten October 4, 2026\nFnB Customer Service\nDear Mr./Ms. \nThank you so much for your wonderful review! \nWe’re delighted to hear that you enjoyed the food, dessert, and attentive service from our team. Your kind words and recommendation mean a lot to us, and we hope to have the pleasure of welcoming you back to Vietnam House again soon.\nWarm Regards,\nVietnam House team.\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
