            "review_title": "Review at Vietnam House Restaurant @ Union Square",
            "review_text": "David L\nSt. Neot, United Kingdom17 contributions\n1\nSuper Vietnamese food in lovely restaurant\nSep 2026 • Solo\nThe food here was top quality … every dish tasted great … the waiter was brilliant through helping me pick and choose with some super recommendations. \n\nIt deserves to be full every evening !!!\nWritten September 29, 2026\nFnB Customer Service\nDear Mr./Ms. \nThank you so much for the wonderful review! We’re so happy to hear you enjoyed the food and that our team’s recommendations made your experience even more enjoyable. It truly means a lot to us. We’d love to have you back at Vietnam House again soon!\nBest Regards,\nVietnam House team.\nRead more\nWritten September 30, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
