            "review_text": "Christian G\n3 contributions\n1\nA Vietnamese mastermind plotted this joint\nSep 2026 • Family\nAbsolutely impeccable view for the natural Vietnamese cultural taste. I cannot put in to words how immaculate the food was. The service from the guys were words only Derik Ray could describe. The pricing was made by an absolute mastermind so perfect and affordable. They filled my stomach right up in an absolute well plotted wait time. Thank You so very much Vietnam house\nRead more\nWritten September 28, 2026\nFnB Customer Service\nDear Mr./Ms. \nThank you for your wonderful review. We are delighted to hear that you enjoyed the Vietnamese flavours, our attentive service, and overall dining experience. Your kind words are truly appreciated, and we look forward to welcoming you back to Vietnam House.\nBest Regards,\nVietnam House team.\nRead more\nWritten September 30, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
