            "review_text": "Radhika K\n2 contributions\n0\nExceptional experience\nSep 2026 • Friends\nWe had an exceptional experience at Vietnam House. We got the pre fix dinner menu. The appetizers were fantastic. Also flavors we haven’t ever tried before. The staff was courteous and very attentive. I would definitely recommend.\nWritten September 27, 2026\nFnB Customer Service\nDear Mr./Ms. \nThank you for sharing your wonderful experience at Vietnam House. We are delighted to hear that you enjoyed our dinner set menu, particularly the appetizers and their distinctive flavours. \nIt is also a pleasure to know that our team made your visit memorable with their attentive and courteous service. Your kind recommendation means a great deal to us, and we look forward to welcoming you back for another memorable dining experience.\nBest Regards,\nVietnam House team.\nRead more\nWritten September 30, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
