            "review_text": "Nicholas B\nMelbourne, Australia1 contribution\n0\nStunning meal in a beautiful ambiance\nSep 2026 • Couples\nWe had such a lovely evening with A serving us, he was a true gentle men explaining the dishes and making us feel welcome. The food was unbelievably delicious and well priced for the quality. A special shout out to the xiao long bao and the pumpkin flower. Also had a couple of cocktails that accompanied the food perfectly. I will be coming back next time I’m in Vietnam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 18, 2026\nFnB Customer Service\nDear Mr./Ms. \nThank you for your lovely review! \nWe’re delighted you enjoyed the food, cocktails, and warm service. We’ll be sure to share your kind words with An. \nWe look forward to welcoming you back to Vietnam House on your next visit to Vietnam!\nWarm Regards,\nVietnam House Team.\nRead more\nWritten September 23, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
